     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi folks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Some of my models take a VERY long time to run in openCR. I’m trying to run 5 sessions on a ‘boom-bust’ species when our response to a bust was to dramatically alter the interval between sessions. Anyway I thought I would try the moving.fit\r\n function. Not sure if I have the code correct, but the model ran (in 2 days versus the normal code which is still working on it after 7 days). The only problem I have is that it looks like moving.fit ignored the session interval. I’ve copied the start of the\r\n output from the third window.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can someone please tell me how my code is messed up?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheryl<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">moving_JSSAsecrfCL&lt;-moving.fit (capthist=BL,mask=mask.clipped,type=&#39;JSSAsecrfCL&#39;,intervals=c(12,12,12,3),model=list(phi~t,lambda0~t,sigma~t,f~t), width = 3, centres = NULL, filestem = GLOBAL_2016_2019AUG_BL,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">            trace = FALSE, FUN = openCR.fit)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR.fit( )<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR 1.2.0, 17:27:01 03 Oct 2019<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">elapsed time 664.5 minutes<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N animals       :  444 \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N detections    :  1114\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N sessions      :  3 (secondary 14)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Intervals       :  1 1\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Analysis type   :  JSSAsecrfCL\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Model           :  lambda0~t phi~t f~t sigma~t\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Fixed (real)    :  none\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Movement model  :  static\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N parameters    :  10\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Log likelihood  :  -1e+10\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AIC             :  2e+10\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AICc            :  2e+10\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Parameter Link\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">lambda0   log\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">phi       logit\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">f         log\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">sigma     log\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">…<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheryl Lohr<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Research Scientist, Animal Science Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>DBCA Biodiversity and Conservation Science<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Location: 37 Wildlife Pl, Woodvale, WA 6026<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mail: Woodvale Wildlife Research Centre<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Locked Bag 104 Bentley Delivery Centre<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNorm