   "subject": "Re: moving.fit and intervals",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div>moving.fit is an experimental solution to the problem of too much data, so I&#39;m not going to die in a ditch for it, but...</div><div>i. get this working with a simple, fast, possibly non-spatial, model before laboring over a spatial full ~t model (though JSSAsecrfCL is a good starting point for open spatial analyses)<br></div><div>ii. incorporate all the sampling intervals in your data - doesn&#39;t make sense to provide them like this, especially as you provide 4 when there are two intervals in width-3 subset of sessions.</div><div>iii. analysing only 3 sessions at a time is very likely to expose weaknesses - open population methods work best with long series; end estimates are the most biased, and with width=3 all estimates are end estimates.<br></div><div>iv. have you tried every other avenue to speed it up (e.g. mask of only about 1000 points; collapsing secondary sessions)?<br></div><div>Murray</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div>On Friday, October 4, 2019 at 2:12:11 PM UTC+13, Cheryl Lohr wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" lang=\"EN-AU\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi folks,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Some of my models take a VERY long time to run in openCR. I’m trying to run 5 sessions on a ‘boom-bust’ species when our response to a bust was to dramatically alter the interval between sessions. Anyway I thought I would try the moving.fit\r\n function. Not sure if I have the code correct, but the model ran (in 2 days versus the normal code which is still working on it after 7 days). The only problem I have is that it looks like moving.fit ignored the session interval. I’ve copied the start of the\r\n output from the third window.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can someone please tell me how my code is messed up?</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheryl</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">moving_JSSAsecrfCL&lt;-moving.fit (capthist=BL,mask=mask.clipped,type=&#39;JSSAsecrfCL&#39;,intervals=c(12,12,12,3),model=list(phi~t,lambda0~t,sigma~t,f~t), width = 3, centres = NULL, filestem = GLOBAL_2016_2019AUG_BL,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">            trace = FALSE, FUN = openCR.fit)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR.fit( )</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR 1.2.0, 17:27:01 03 Oct 2019</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">elapsed time 664.5 minutes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N animals       :  444 \r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N detections    :  1114\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N sessions      :  3 (secondary 14)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Intervals       :  1 1\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Analysis type   :  JSSAsecrfCL\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Model           :  lambda0~t phi~t f~t sigma~t\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Fixed (real)    :  none\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Movement model  :  static\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N parameters    :  10\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Log likelihood  :  -1e+10\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AIC             :  2e+10\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AICc            :  2e+10\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Parameter Link\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">lambda0   log\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">phi       logit\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">f         log\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">sigma     log\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">…</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheryl Lohr</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Research Scientist, Animal Science Program</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>DBCA Biodiversity and Conservation Science</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Location: 37 Wildlife Pl, Woodvale, WA 6026</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mail: Woodvale Wildlife Research Centre</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Locked Bag 104 Bentley Delivery Centre</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">WA 6983</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Ph: 94055150 (internal ext 5750)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Mob: 0407335004</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><img style=\"width:5.9062in;min-height:1.5729in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/secrgroup/attach/bafab6cdca6f2/image003.jpg?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"20170208_DBCA Signature block updated\" width=\"567\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<small>\r\n<hr>\r\n<i>This message is confidential and is intended for the recipient named above. If you are not the intended recipient, you must not disclose, use or copy the message or any part of it. If you received this message in error, please notify the sender immediately\r\n by replying to this message, then delete it from your system.</i></small>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>"
