    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">moving.fit is an experimental solution to the problem of too much data, so I&#39;m not going to die in a ditch for it, but...<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">i. get this working with a simple, fast, possibly non-spatial, model before laboring over a spatial full ~t model (though JSSAsecrfCL is a good starting point for open spatial analyses)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">ii. incorporate all the sampling intervals in your data - doesn&#39;t make sense to provide them like this, especially as you provide 4 when there are two intervals in width-3 subset of sessions.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">iii. analysing only 3 sessions at a time is very likely to expose weaknesses - open population methods work best with long series; end estimates are the most biased, and with width=3 all estimates are end estimates.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">iv. have you tried every other avenue to speed it up (e.g. mask of only about 1000 points; collapsing secondary sessions)?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Murray<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Friday, October 4, 2019 at 2:12:11 PM UTC+13, Cheryl Lohr wrote:\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi folks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Some of my models take a VERY long time to run in openCR. I’m trying to run 5 sessions on a ‘boom-bust’ species when our response to a bust was to dramatically alter the interval\r\n between sessions. Anyway I thought I would try the moving.fit function. Not sure if I have the code correct, but the model ran (in 2 days versus the normal code which is still working on it after 7 days). The only problem I have is that it looks like moving.fit\r\n ignored the session interval. I’ve copied the start of the output from the third window.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can someone please tell me how my code is messed up?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheryl<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">moving_JSSAsecrfCL&lt;-moving.fit (capthist=BL,mask=mask.clipped,type=&#39;JSSAsecrfCL&#39;,intervals=c(12,12,12,3),model=list(phi~t,lambda0~t,sigma~t,f~t), width = 3, centres = NULL, filestem\r\n = GLOBAL_2016_2019AUG_BL,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">            trace = FALSE, FUN = openCR.fit)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR.fit( )</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">openCR 1.2.0, 17:27:01 03 Oct 2019</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">elapsed time 664.5 minutes</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N animals       :  444 \r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N detections    :  1114\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N sessions      :  3 (secondary 14)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Intervals       :  1 1\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Analysis type   :  JSSAsecrfCL\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Model           :  lambda0~t phi~t f~t sigma~t\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Fixed (real)    :  none\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Movement model  :  static\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">N parameters    :  10\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Log likelihood  :  -1e+10\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AIC             :  2e+10\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">AICc            :  2e+10\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Parameter Link\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">lambda0   log\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">phi       logit\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">f         log\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">sigma     log\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">…<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheryl Lohr<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Research Scientist, Animal Science Program<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">DBCA Biodiversity and Conservation Science<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Location: 37 Wildlife Pl, Woodvale, WA 6026<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mail: Woodvale Wildlife Research Centre<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Locked Bag 104 Bentley Delivery Centre<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">WA 6983<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ph: 94055150 (internal ext 5750)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mob: 0407335004<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img width=\"567\" height=\"151\" style=\"width:5.9062in;min-height:1.5729in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/secrgroup/attach/bafab6cdca6f2/image003.jpg?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser